# Prisma migrations are the source of truth for the DB and MUST be committed.
# Overrides a global `*.sql` ignore, which silently kept them out of the repo
# and left `prisma migrate deploy` on Vercel with nothing to apply.
!apps/api/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql
